{
  "description": "认证配置示例 - 支持多个 API Key 的故障转移",
  "auth_profiles": [
    {
      "id": "openai-primary",
      "provider": "openai",
      "api_key": "sk-your-primary-key-here",
      "base_url": null
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-backup",
      "provider": "openai",
      "api_key": "sk-your-backup-key-here",
      "base_url": null
    },
    {
      "id": "openai-custom-endpoint",
      "provider": "openai",
      "api_key": "sk-your-custom-key-here",
      "base_url": "https://your-custom-endpoint.com/v1"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "复制此文件为 auth_profiles.json 并填入真实的 API Key",
    "系统会按顺序尝试每个配置",
    "失败的配置会进入冷却期 (指数退避)",
    "如果没有配置文件,系统会从环境变量读取 OPENAI_API_KEY"
  ]
}

